# Public Directory
#
# This directory contains static assets served at the root URL.
# Files in this directory can be referenced with a leading slash, e.g. /favicon.ico
#
# Common files:
# - favicon.ico / favicon.png - Site icon
# - robots.txt - Search engine crawler instructions
# - manifest.json / site.webmanifest - PWA manifest
# - apple-touch-icon.png - iOS home screen icon
# - og-image.png - Open Graph image for social sharing
#
# Note: Next.js serves files from this directory at the root path.
# For example, public/icon.png is accessible at /icon.png
